/surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Fam</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Farber</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Flechtner</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Franklin</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gatter</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamaty</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lessard</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lichtbroun</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Masi</surname><given-names>AT</given-names></name><name><surname>McCain</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Reynolds</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Romano</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Russell</surname><given-names>IJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheon</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The American College of Rheumatology 1990 Criteria for the Classification of Fibromyalgia. Report ofthe Multicenter Criteria Committee</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>1990</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>160</fpage><lpage>72</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2306288</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Millea</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Holloway</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Treating fibromyalgia</article-title><source>Am Fam Physician</source><year>2000</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>1575</fpage><lpage>82</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11037075</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lindell</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergman</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Petersson</surname><given-names>IF</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobsson</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name><name><surname>Herrstrom</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence of fibromyalgia and chronic widespread pain</article-title><source>Scand J Prim Health Care</source><year>2000</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>53</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11097099</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/028134300453340</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>